  ["i have my hands full with all these good for nothing workers and feathered annoyances if you re not here to get rid of one of those two problems then you can sod off right away"] = "Interface\\AddOns\\TurtlesEpoch\\sounds\\narrator\\foreman_pipelatch\\quest_complete_d9836142.ogg",
