  ["i have received news that the humans did their part precisely as planned they have brought our little gift into their main camp you did marvelously my dear"] = "Interface\\AddOns\\TurtlesEpoch\\sounds\\undead\\duchess_grelda\\quest_complete_3aa77973.ogg",
