  ["i hope these pesky guards weren t much of an issue thank you class this will be invaluable in my research"] = "Interface\\AddOns\\TurtlesEpoch\\sounds\\high_elf\\calhir_dawnchaser\\quest_complete_dee99256.ogg",
  ["i hope they didn t give you too much trouble name i try to steer clear of them they re wild i tried jumping over one i was attacked plants just shouldn t be acting that way"] = "Interface\\AddOns\\TurtlesEpoch\\sounds\\human\\muigin\\quest_complete_c42e4b4f.ogg",
