  ["i m happy to see shanda has sent you to find me name teaching young priests the ways of elune gives me great satisfaction"] = "Interface\\AddOns\\TurtlesEpoch\\sounds\\night_elf\\laurna_morninglight\\quest_complete_d83d7f36.ogg",
  ["i m happy you re seeing the error of your ways name keep the supplies coming we re not going to forget about you so easily mister"] = "Interface\\AddOns\\TurtlesEpoch\\sounds\\goblin\\mupsi_shacklefridd\\quest_complete_2877663d.ogg",
  ["i m impressed class but there s no time to lose i will give you your next task because you will still need to acquire a few more important components before we can proceed speak to me again when you feel that you are rea"] = "Interface\\AddOns\\TurtlesEpoch\\sounds\\gnome\\bodley\\quest_complete_7f53fe0a.ogg",
