  ["i must commend you for your work i am sure many of those here are relieved to have one less threat be waiting at the doorstep i have gathered a suitable reward for the work you have put in may it help you on your journey"] = "Interface\\AddOns\\TurtlesEpoch\\sounds\\human\\commander_baelos\\quest_complete_f9de2184.ogg",
  ["i must remove the taint from this object this may shed some light on my recent failures to delve into the dream give it to me"] = "Interface\\AddOns\\TurtlesEpoch\\sounds\\keeper_of_the_grove\\keeper_remulos\\quest_complete_75d07dee.ogg",
