  ["it is only a matter of time until the magram rise to their destiny your actions are worthy of praise and i will let the others know of your deeds"] = "Interface\\AddOns\\TurtlesEpoch\\sounds\\centaur\\warcaller_dekshar\\quest_complete_7ccc027d.ogg",
  ["it is only fitting that you receive a trinket of far greater power than the one you sacrificed to get here use it in good health name"] = "Interface\\AddOns\\TurtlesEpoch\\sounds\\dwarf\\galvan_the_ancient\\quest_complete_9a4db333.ogg",
