  ["it is strange that the warchief would expend so much over such a small thing i do not claim to understand him but i will follow him whatever his commands you did well name no doubt the warchief will be glad to hear of yo"] = "Interface\\AddOns\\TurtlesEpoch\\sounds\\orc\\krusk\\quest_complete_61e6dece.ogg",
  ["it is time to branch out race the world awaits"] = "Interface\\AddOns\\TurtlesEpoch\\sounds\\night_elf\\erion_shadewhisper\\quest_complete_5997441a.ogg",
