  ["it is troubling to hear of the scourge slipping past the bulwark the lich king and his minions are ceaseless in their assaults but we will not give in he will not take us again"] = "Interface\\AddOns\\TurtlesEpoch\\sounds\\undead\\magistrate_sevren\\quest_complete_f9113252.ogg",
