  ["it is true that i know a bit more about these crates but it has been quite some time since i last saw them in person"] = "Interface\\AddOns\\TurtlesEpoch\\sounds\\narrator\\unknown\\quest_complete_c002c9e6.ogg",
  ["it is unfortunate that the scourge cannot be brought into the fold their large numbers would be useful in the battles ahead but they will not join us so we have no choice but to destroy them"] = "Interface\\AddOns\\TurtlesEpoch\\sounds\\undead\\shadow_priest_sarvis\\quest_complete_f089e4d6.ogg",
  ["it is worse than i imagined nineteen of my men could have been spared from the agony which they faced if only i had not acted so irrationally you must help them name i am powerless to act"] = "Interface\\AddOns\\TurtlesEpoch\\sounds\\orc\\fallen_hero_of_the_horde\\quest_complete_4843c21d.ogg",
  ["it is you who must lead our troops to victory commander name the soldiers are under your command they will follow your direct orders lead them crush the frostwolf"] = "Interface\\AddOns\\TurtlesEpoch\\sounds\\dwarf\\lieutenant_haggerdin\\quest_complete_723bd14d.ogg",
  ["it it is hard for me to even believe that what i hold now is that which has held me for so long let us waste no time name when the seal is destroyed i might walk the forests of the earth freely again"] = "Interface\\AddOns\\TurtlesEpoch\\sounds\\night_elf\\asterion\\quest_complete_d965c03c.ogg",
