  ["it may be faint but there is power emanating from these gems the best jewelcrafters are able to extract their mighty essences and amplify them to unprecedented heights and if you ll allow me to say this you are on a good"] = "Interface\\AddOns\\TurtlesEpoch\\sounds\\troll\\jarkal_mossmeld\\quest_complete_1ff2bc13.ogg",
