  ["it may seem cruel of me to ask you to put them to rest my own people but fear not stranger as the sun comes up on the morrow they too shall rise again"] = "Interface\\AddOns\\TurtlesEpoch\\sounds\\human\\forgotten_keeper\\quest_complete_b8f762b6.ogg",
  ["it may seem mindless to many and to many it is this hunt of dragons does not come simply at the whims of one orc s sport where these dragons were once meant to protect they now seek to destroy"] = "Interface\\AddOns\\TurtlesEpoch\\sounds\\orc\\gordush_jawtaker\\quest_complete_30631b6f.ogg",
  ["it pains me it had to come to this but their delusions have brought them too far away from redemption for the sake of nature and its inhabitants they had to return to the cycle"] = "Interface\\AddOns\\TurtlesEpoch\\sounds\\keeper_of_the_grove\\keeper_bandalar\\quest_complete_acf8a1a9.ogg",
  ["it pains me to ask of such things the blackroot were once our friends and dearest allies as much as it hurts to look upon familiar faces and see friends it is good to know they are now free from the evil that gripped the"] = "Interface\\AddOns\\TurtlesEpoch\\sounds\\furbolg\\raghol\\quest_complete_62468aa7.ogg",
