  ["it pains my soul to imagine it has come to this it feels as if there is no light left within this once beautiful forest i thank you for easing the troubled minds maybe they can find clarity in the afterlife take this i w"] = "Interface\\AddOns\\TurtlesEpoch\\sounds\\furbolg\\grol_the_exile\\quest_complete_13d4d0cd.ogg",
