  ["it s good to see fresh troops here name but with a little luck you ll get into some action and won t be fresh for long speak with me again i have tasks i must discuss with you"] = "Interface\\AddOns\\TurtlesEpoch\\sounds\\dwarf\\stormpike_quartermaster\\quest_complete_63d392c0.ogg",
